{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015rztE8XktQPo2gK4wk6r8e","type":"tool_result","content":"The Free plan includes **1,000 credits per month**. The page says these are \"refreshed monthly,\" so the credits recur rather than being a one-time grant.\n\n**Rate limits on Free:**\n- /scrape, /map, /search: 10 requests per minute\n- /crawl and /agent: 2 requests per minute\n- /interact: 2 browser sandbox sessions per minute\n- 2 concurrent browsers\n\n**Credit card:** No. The FAQ states that \"no card is required\" to sign up for the free tier."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4ca89159-9b00-4b4e-9331-63bbd16a50bd","uuid":"03d62b20-4ca0-4dea-aa3a-233d3ae59c29","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:42:24.250Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":799545,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"The Free plan includes **1,000 credits per month**. The page says these are \"refreshed monthly,\" so the credits recur rather than being a one-time grant.\n\n**Rate limits on Free:**\n- /scrape, /map, /search: 10 requests per minute\n- /crawl and /agent: 2 requests per minute\n- /interact: 2 browser sandbox sessions per minute\n- 2 concurrent browsers\n\n**Credit card:** No. The FAQ states that \"no card is required\" to sign up for the free tier.","durationMs":5860,"url":"https://www.firecrawl.dev/pricing"},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_015rztE8XktQPo2gK4wk6r8e","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
